{"text":"7 tools I offer you today. Recognize and articulate your fears to yourself. Then look for what you love and articulate that to yourself and to others. Do this often and your love will grow stronger than your fear. 2. Reach out to your stretcher bearers. This is a concept I carried with me from a high school Bible teaching. It speaks of a time when Jesus was teaching a crowd of people that had come from all over. Some men came late carrying their paralyzed friend on a stretcher. It was so crowded around Jesus so they decided to go up on the roof, take out the tiles and lower the man into the middle of the crowd in front of Jesus. When Jesus saw their faith and how much love they had, he cured the man instantly of his paralysis. My teacher in her message encouraged us to make sure we too had those stretcher bearers in our lives. At least 4 people who would carry us to healing and safety when we can't do it for ourselves.","words":[{"text":"7","start":0.0,"end":0.98},{"text":"tools","start":0.98,"end":1.4},{"text":"I","start":1.4,"end":1.58},{"text":"offer","start":1.58,"end":1.84},{"text":"you","start":1.84,"end":2.12},{"text":"today","start":2.12,"end":2.52,"punct":"."},{"text":"Recognize","start":4.16,"end":4.66},{"text":"and","start":4.66,"end":4.82},{"text":"articulate","start":4.82,"end":5.38},{"text":"your","start":5.38,"end":5.68},{"text":"fears","start":5.68,"end":6.0},{"text":"to","start":6.0,"end":6.26},{"text":"yourself","start":6.26,"end":6.76,"punct":"."},{"text":"Then","start":7.52,"end":7.66},{"text":"look","start":7.66,"end":7.84},{"text":"for","start":7.84,"end":8.06},{"text":"what","start":8.06,"end":8.24},{"text":"you","start":8.24,"end":8.46},{"text":"love","start":8.46,"end":8.8},{"text":"and","start":8.8,"end":9.42},{"text":"articulate","start":9.42,"end":9.88},{"text":"that","start":9.88,"end":10.36},{"text":"to","start":10.36,"end":10.54},{"text":"yourself","start":10.54,"end":10.88},{"text":"and","start":10.88,"end":11.14},{"text":"to